# Orchestrator entry point

For features, phase work, new endpoints, or non-trivial bugs:

1. **`orchestrator`** — name Phase + Area (`/orchestrator`)
2. New endpoint/phase → **`scenario-contract`** → wait `تایید شد` / `approved`
3. **`feature-scaffold`** or minimal fix
4. **`verify-feature`** + FE handoff note at phase DoD

Phase matrix and DoD: `AGENTS.md` §3 and Backend Guide.  
FE mirror: `Documents/TICKETING-SYSTEM-IMPLEMENTATION-PHASES-v1.md`.
